Output docs/assets/voice-model-requests.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1280
Set Height 900
Set Padding 12
Set Framerate 12
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Hide
Type "NO_MOTION=1 ./bin/voice-model-requests observe --dialect obey-voice testdata/fixtures/pipeline-trace/model-requests.jsonl"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "["
Sleep 500ms
Show
Sleep 2s
Screenshot docs/assets/voice-model-requests-flow.png
Down
Sleep 300ms
Down
Sleep 300ms
Down
Sleep 300ms
Down
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 3s
Screenshot docs/assets/voice-model-requests-details.png
Escape
Sleep 1s
Type "3"
Sleep 2s
Screenshot docs/assets/voice-model-requests-timeline.png
Type "]"
Sleep 2s
Type "1"
Sleep 2s
Type "s"
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "3"
Sleep 2s
Type "q"
Sleep 500ms
